## Current Design Details

Preferred app:

```text
WGO DTX Node Check
```

Preferred config:

```text
dtx-node-check.json
```

Node inference:

- Uses local read-only signals only.
- Scores each node role.
- If best score is high enough and sufficiently better than the next score,
  selects node automatically.
- Otherwise leaves node unset and asks the user to select it in the UI.

Current detection threshold:

- best score must be at least 3
- best score must exceed second score by at least 2

Detection signals:

- configured required directories
- configured required files
- configured required processes
- configured required services
- configured required TCP listeners
- general DTX process/program/service presence

Known limitation:

- With the current sample config, Workstation and Client are very similar.
  Real deployments should enrich `dtx-node-check.json` with node-specific
  services, files, directories, or ports to improve automatic inference.

## Read-Only Safety Notes

Allowed:

- read local filesystem metadata
- check file/directory existence
- read process list
- query services read-only
- read local TCP listeners
- read installed programs from registry read-only
- write report/log when the desktop workflow produces report/log output
- open report file after run
- open config file when user clicks `Apri config`
- open official documentation links only when user clicks them

Not allowed:

- modify registry
- modify services
- change firewall
- change DNS
- change hosts file
- change network
- run PowerShell
- run shell commands from the app
- send automatic network traffic

## Packaging Notes

Self-contained deployment is mandatory for desktop projects.

`Directory.Build.targets` blocks:

- desktop publish without Runtime Identifier
- desktop publish with `SelfContained` not equal to `true`

Generated deploy folders are ignored by git:

```text
artifacts/deploy/
artifacts/deploy-self-contained/
artifacts/inno/
```

Previously generated self-contained packages were created under:

```text
artifacts/deploy-self-contained/packages/
```

Current preferred publishing commands:

```bash
dotnet publish src/DtxNodeCheck.App/DtxNodeCheck.App.csproj -c Release -r win-x64
dotnet publish src/DtxNodeCheck.App/DtxNodeCheck.App.csproj -c Release -r osx-arm64
```

